    "observations": [
      "The readable function constructs the adjacent runtime.dll path, uses native Windows file/mapping APIs, and transfers control to the mapped runtime entry.",
      "It resolves wine_get_version through LdrGetProcedureAddress and contains a manual mapping path associated with Wine. This is not proof Remote Play works under Wine.",
      "NT memory allocation/protection in this function affects host process memory; no controller transport is identified in it.",
      "The ordinal-2 link function at RVA 0x37f0 is an immediate return."
    ]
  },
